Journey: The portal sends its security headers and cookie flags, and never shows another customer's claim
Id: security-portal
Tags: @security @nonfunctional @portal
Role: policyholder
Risk: 5
Requirements: SEC-1, SEC-4
Lenses: security

Log in
Open /app/home
  Expect the page contains "Your policies"
Click the "My claims" link
  Expect the page contains "My claims"
Click the "Make a claim" link
  Expect the page contains "Make a claim"

# Object-level authorization: CLM-100001 belongs to another customer (Bramble Property Group)
Open /bff/claims/CLM-100001
  Expect the page contains "not found"
Expect the page does not contain "Bramble"
Open /bff/claims/CLM-100001/statement.pdf
  Expect the page contains "not found"
